    "name": "NOX AETERNA - Veil of Darkness",
    "steam_appid": 3436630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of NOX AETERNA - Veil of Darkness!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating, immersive narrative brought to life by enchanting, unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This graphical text adventure tells the story of a naive yet curious teenager who, with the support of his friends, delves into the <strong>mystery</strong> of a classmate's hospitalization under unexplained circumstances. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll experience sometimes <strong>philosophical</strong>, often <strong>funny</strong> but at the same time <strong>deep</strong> and <strong>serious</strong> dialogues. You forge new friendships and uncover secrets that were meant to remain hidden from the human world forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436630/extras/35cf648a519319504e83ae2aca97e3a5.avif?t=1745264603\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game lasts about an hour - but that's <strong>just the beginning</strong>. Replay the story, make different decisions and experience the story from new perspectives and uncover all its layers and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game automatically saves at any time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotionally gripping and deeply immersive story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moody, atmospheric visuals, ambient sounds, sound effects, and epic music scores come together to create a engaging experience</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of NOX AETERNA - Veil of Darkness!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating, immersive narrative brought to life by enchanting, unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This graphical text adventure tells the story of a naive yet curious teenager who, with the support of his friends, delves into the <strong>mystery</strong> of a classmate's hospitalization under unexplained circumstances. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll experience sometimes <strong>philosophical</strong>, often <strong>funny</strong> but at the same time <strong>deep</strong> and <strong>serious</strong> dialogues. You forge new friendships and uncover secrets that were meant to remain hidden from the human world forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436630/extras/35cf648a519319504e83ae2aca97e3a5.avif?t=1745264603\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game lasts about an hour - but that's <strong>just the beginning</strong>. Replay the story, make different decisions and experience the story from new perspectives and uncover all its layers and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game automatically saves at any time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotionally gripping and deeply immersive story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moody, atmospheric visuals, ambient sounds, sound effects, and epic music scores come together to create a engaging experience</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "On your journey in this sometimes philosophical text adventure, discover unforgettable characters and secrets that must remain hidden from the human world forever..",
